1
00:00:46,320 --> 00:00:47,240
Three years ago,

2
00:00:47,880 --> 00:00:49,719
Old Master Sheng was gravely ill.

3
00:00:49,960 --> 00:00:51,560
On his deathbed, he gave orders

4
00:00:51,560 --> 00:00:54,799
to find someone born with a

5
00:00:54,799 --> 00:00:56,439
Pure Yin Destiny.

6
00:00:56,439 --> 00:00:58,960
A son-in-law with this Destiny Chart

7
00:00:59,240 --> 00:01:02,359
to avert a huge disaster for the Shengs.

8
00:01:02,359 --> 00:01:03,399
And I,

9
00:01:04,920 --> 00:01:06,599
am that very person.

10
00:01:09,959 --> 00:01:11,560
How do you know this?

11
00:01:11,599 --> 00:01:12,640
I also know

12
00:01:13,280 --> 00:01:16,040
that The Four Great Families,
on the fifteenth of next month,

13
00:01:16,599 --> 00:01:18,519
will all face a sudden disaster.

14
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:21,000
You are seeking the Dragon-Seeking Ruler

15
00:01:21,239 --> 00:01:22,959
to help you locate the place
from twenty years ago,

16
00:01:22,959 --> 00:01:25,359
that Tidal Tomb you all visited.

17
00:01:25,439 --> 00:01:27,760
And I, this human shield,

18
00:01:27,760 --> 00:01:32,000
am meant to ward off disaster and evil
for you along the way.

19
00:01:32,480 --> 00:01:34,159
So, my dear mother-in-law,

20
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:35,879
you'd better be nice to me.

21
00:01:36,200 --> 00:01:37,159
Otherwise,

22
00:01:37,680 --> 00:01:40,000
a human shield like me...

23
00:01:40,439 --> 00:01:41,480
The Mei and Wan families

24
00:01:41,959 --> 00:01:43,719
are both fighting over me.

25
00:01:49,799 --> 00:01:52,079
My dear son-in-law, what I said earlier...

26
00:01:52,079 --> 00:01:54,719
was all just for the outsiders to hear.

27
00:01:54,719 --> 00:01:57,840
How could we find fault with our own?

28
00:01:59,640 --> 00:02:00,439
Alright.

29
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:02,560
Wait here for your friend

30
00:02:02,879 --> 00:02:04,159
and come home early.

31
00:02:04,200 --> 00:02:06,560
Mother will be waiting for you for dinner.

32
00:02:11,879 --> 00:02:12,680
Holy crap.

33
00:02:13,319 --> 00:02:15,039
"Waiting for you for dinner"?

34
00:02:16,360 --> 00:02:17,159
Forget it.

35
00:02:18,080 --> 00:02:19,319
I'd better just go back by myself.

36
00:02:23,639 --> 00:02:24,479
You!

37
00:02:26,159 --> 00:02:27,000
How did you get out?

38
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:28,159
That female ghost thought I was too ugly,

39
00:02:28,159 --> 00:02:29,280
so she kicked me out.

40
00:02:30,360 --> 00:02:31,719
Young Master, what were you mumbling about?

41
00:02:33,080 --> 00:02:33,919
I was saying...

42
00:02:35,400 --> 00:02:36,879
"waiting for you for dinner."

43
00:02:36,919 --> 00:02:37,719
No, hold on.

44
00:02:38,120 --> 00:02:39,879
We need to have a little chat before dinner.

45
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:40,680
Come on, take a seat.

46
00:02:41,759 --> 00:02:43,080
I just don't get it.

47
00:02:43,120 --> 00:02:45,319
That woman in red knelt to you,

48
00:02:45,759 --> 00:02:48,599
and that little girl didn't dare approach.

49
00:02:48,599 --> 00:02:49,400
Why was that?

50
00:02:50,280 --> 00:02:51,400
Actually, it's just that

51
00:02:51,800 --> 00:02:53,479
the metallic artifacts here

52
00:02:53,680 --> 00:02:56,840
and rock structures created
an abnormal magnetic field,

53
00:02:56,840 --> 00:02:59,319
causing past secret room images to replay.

54
00:02:59,680 --> 00:03:01,240
Plus, it can interfere with human brain waves.

55
00:03:01,280 --> 00:03:02,680
In fact, it was all fake.

56
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:06,879
I didn't get that, but it doesn't matter.

57
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:08,199
Young Master, if we sell this thing,

58
00:03:08,199 --> 00:03:09,560
could we afford to get two wives?

59
00:03:10,639 --> 00:03:11,800
The Dragon-Seeking Ruler!

60
00:03:12,400 --> 00:03:13,400
You brought it out!

61
00:03:15,919 --> 00:03:17,000
Great.

62
00:03:17,719 --> 00:03:18,639
With this,

63
00:03:18,680 --> 00:03:21,319
I can retrieve what I want, step by step.

64
00:03:21,360 --> 00:03:22,639
What plan?

65
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:27,680
Becoming the Sheng son-in-law is step one.

66
00:03:28,479 --> 00:03:32,560
The real show has just begun.

67
00:03:53,879 --> 00:03:54,759
Did you hear?

68
00:03:54,879 --> 00:03:55,840
That guy

69
00:03:56,039 --> 00:03:58,439
tried to force himself on the young miss.

70
00:03:59,400 --> 00:04:00,840
Talk about desperate.

71
00:04:00,879 --> 00:04:02,240
More than just desperate.

72
00:04:02,240 --> 00:04:03,639
He's a total pervert.

73
00:04:57,519 --> 00:04:58,519
The Sheng family...

74
00:04:59,560 --> 00:05:01,199
Have they already started?

75
00:05:05,160 --> 00:05:07,399
Water Qi converges at the center.

76
00:05:07,439 --> 00:05:09,759
Earth veins run southwest.

77
00:05:10,439 --> 00:05:11,800
And then...

78
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:13,279
What are you mumbling, Young Master?

79
00:05:15,279 --> 00:05:17,399
This is a fragment of the
Earth Vein Incantation Scripture.

80
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:20,959
It's used with the Dragon-Seeking Ruler.

81
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:25,759
Isn't the Earth Vein Incantation Scripture
the Sheng family's treasure?

82
00:05:25,759 --> 00:05:26,560
How do you know it?

83
00:05:28,680 --> 00:05:31,959
I just picked up a little bit by accident.

84
00:06:44,800 --> 00:06:46,240
You... aren't you already dead?

85
00:06:46,240 --> 00:06:48,079
I'm taking you down to keep me company.

86
00:06:50,680 --> 00:06:51,680
Go to hell!

87
00:06:57,959 --> 00:06:58,560
The outhouse is over there.

88
00:06:58,560 --> 00:06:59,519
Don't let him get away!

89
00:06:59,879 --> 00:07:00,959
If he falls in, we'll have to fish him out.

90
00:07:00,959 --> 00:07:01,639
You said it.

91
00:07:01,759 --> 00:07:03,759
We were really in sync back in that room.

92
00:07:03,759 --> 00:07:05,720
One look and you knew what I wanted to do.

93
00:07:06,160 --> 00:07:07,160
Then the master's room...

94
00:07:23,079 --> 00:07:23,680
Go take a look.

95
00:07:23,680 --> 00:07:24,920
Hope he didn't really go crazy from fear.

96
00:07:28,319 --> 00:07:29,120
Master!

97
00:07:29,839 --> 00:07:30,639
Master!

98
00:07:35,079 --> 00:07:36,279
Don't kill me!

99
00:07:37,279 --> 00:07:38,199
Don't kill me!

100
00:07:40,920 --> 00:07:41,560
This...

101
00:07:41,560 --> 00:07:42,240
Master!

102
00:07:42,680 --> 00:07:43,879
What happened here?

103
00:07:44,040 --> 00:07:46,360
Wake up, Master!

104
00:07:46,920 --> 00:07:47,879
Master!

105
00:07:48,120 --> 00:07:50,279
Wake up, Master!

106
00:07:51,319 --> 00:07:52,720
Don't scare me, Master!

107
00:07:52,720 --> 00:07:54,279
Please, wake up!

108
00:07:54,639 --> 00:07:56,439
Master!

109
00:07:57,399 --> 00:07:59,519
Oh, Master!

110
00:08:01,199 --> 00:08:03,480
Master!

111
00:08:11,279 --> 00:08:12,079
Tiankun.

112
00:08:13,040 --> 00:08:14,040
You're saying...

113
00:08:14,600 --> 00:08:17,040
Sheng Qiufeng is dead?

114
00:08:17,399 --> 00:08:20,360
He was scared to death. Such huge eyes!

115
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:23,800
No, wait.

116
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:25,800
Why go to his place so late at night?

117
00:08:29,680 --> 00:08:30,399
I heard...

118
00:08:30,399 --> 00:08:33,080
that good-for-nothing had the nerve
to go back to the Shengs.

119
00:08:33,200 --> 00:08:35,639
If he talks about what we did
in the secret room,

120
00:08:36,279 --> 00:08:38,000
it would be very bad for us.

121
00:08:40,919 --> 00:08:42,639
As long as that kid is alive,

122
00:08:43,120 --> 00:08:45,000
the Shengs have no reason
to divorce him right away.

123
00:08:45,240 --> 00:08:46,799
If they don't divorce him,

124
00:08:47,519 --> 00:08:49,200
how am I supposed to marry Ling Yu?

125
00:08:49,600 --> 00:08:51,039
And if I can't marry Ling Yu,

126
00:08:51,279 --> 00:08:54,399
how can my father take over the Shengs?

127
00:08:56,159 --> 00:08:57,440
Got it, got it.

128
00:08:57,519 --> 00:08:58,919
Or I could just...

129
00:08:59,559 --> 00:09:00,759
I knew it.

130
00:09:01,039 --> 00:09:03,159
So crude and low-class!

131
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:06,279
Look, don't we have the talisman book now?

132
00:09:06,279 --> 00:09:07,240
The Fierce Ghost Talisman.

133
00:09:07,480 --> 00:09:09,399
Even immortals would be scared to death,

134
00:09:09,919 --> 00:09:11,480
let alone that little piece of trash.

135
00:09:13,879 --> 00:09:15,000
Let me show you one first.

136
00:09:18,159 --> 00:09:19,320
So ugly!

137
00:09:25,240 --> 00:09:25,919
Boring.

138
00:09:28,360 --> 00:09:29,159
Father.

139
00:09:29,919 --> 00:09:31,519
The Sheng family head is dead.

140
00:09:31,679 --> 00:09:34,399
Isn't this the perfect time
to take over the Shengs?

141
00:09:34,799 --> 00:09:35,960
Keep dreaming.

142
00:09:36,080 --> 00:09:38,039
Don't they still have a Young Master?

143
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:40,879
Young Master?

144
00:09:41,960 --> 00:09:43,320
Father, now that you mention it,

145
00:09:43,799 --> 00:09:45,360
all of this is way too coincidental.

146
00:10:01,399 --> 00:10:02,279
Young Master.

147
00:10:02,759 --> 00:10:05,759
People have been dying mysteriously
these past few years,

148
00:10:05,759 --> 00:10:07,960
and now it's our family head's turn.

149
00:10:08,159 --> 00:10:09,279
Instead of going to the mourning hall,

150
00:10:09,279 --> 00:10:10,759
why are you wandering around here?

151
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:15,559
Look.

152
00:10:17,279 --> 00:10:18,200
What does this mean?

153
00:10:18,480 --> 00:10:19,360
Is there a tomb here?

154
00:10:19,360 --> 00:10:20,360
Are we living on top of graves?

155
00:10:40,679 --> 00:10:41,759
No, it's still over here.

156
00:10:41,840 --> 00:10:42,960
Keep looking.
